[{"text":"HypergeometricAC[n][exp] analytically continues Hypergeometric2F1 functions in exp. The second argument n refers to the equation number (n) in chapter 2.10 of “Higher Transcendental Functions” by Erdelyi, Magnus, Oberhettinger, Tricomi. In case of eq. (6) (p.109) the last line is returned for HypergeometricAC[6][exp], while the first equality is given by HypergeometricAC[61][exp].","anchor":"hypergeometricac"},{"text":"(2.10.1) is identical to eq. (9.5.7) of “Special Functions & their Applications” by N.N.Lebedev.","anchor":"hypergeometricac"},{"text":"Overview, HypExplicit, HypergeometricIR, HypergeometricSE, ToHypergeometric.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"These are all transformation rules currently built in.","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"HypergeometricAC[1][Hypergeometric2F1[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], z]]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) \\Gamma (\\alpha +\\beta -\\gamma ) (1-z)^{-\\alpha -\\beta +\\gamma } \\, _2F_1(\\gamma -\\alpha ,\\gamma -\\beta ;-\\alpha -\\beta +\\gamma +1;1-z)}{\\Gamma (\\alpha ) \\Gamma (\\beta )}+\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) \\Gamma (-\\alpha -\\beta +\\gamma ) \\, _2F_1(\\alpha ,\\beta ;\\alpha +\\beta -\\gamma +1;1-z)}{\\Gamma (\\gamma -\\alpha ) \\Gamma (\\gamma -\\beta )}\\]","anchor":"cb1-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"HypergeometricAC[2][Hypergeometric2F1[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], z]]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) (-z)^{-\\alpha } \\Gamma (\\beta -\\alpha ) \\, _2F_1\\left(\\alpha ,\\alpha -\\gamma +1;\\alpha -\\beta +1;\\frac{1}{z}\\right)}{\\Gamma (\\beta ) \\Gamma (\\gamma -\\alpha )}+\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) (-z)^{-\\beta } \\Gamma (\\alpha -\\beta ) \\, _2F_1\\left(\\beta ,\\beta -\\gamma +1;-\\alpha +\\beta +1;\\frac{1}{z}\\right)}{\\Gamma (\\alpha ) \\Gamma (\\gamma -\\beta )}\\]","anchor":"cb2-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"HypergeometricAC[3][Hypergeometric2F1[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], z]]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) (1-z)^{-\\alpha } \\Gamma (\\beta -\\alpha ) \\, _2F_1\\left(\\alpha ,\\gamma -\\beta ;\\alpha -\\beta +1;\\frac{1}{1-z}\\right)}{\\Gamma (\\beta ) \\Gamma (\\gamma -\\alpha )}+\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) (1-z)^{-\\beta } \\Gamma (\\alpha -\\beta ) \\, _2F_1\\left(\\beta ,\\gamma -\\alpha ;-\\alpha +\\beta +1;\\frac{1}{1-z}\\right)}{\\Gamma (\\alpha ) \\Gamma (\\gamma -\\beta )}\\]","anchor":"cb3-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"HypergeometricAC[4][Hypergeometric2F1[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], z]]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) z^{-\\alpha } \\Gamma (-\\alpha -\\beta +\\gamma ) \\, _2F_1\\left(\\alpha ,\\alpha -\\gamma +1;\\alpha +\\beta -\\gamma +1;-\\frac{1-z}{z}\\right)}{\\Gamma (\\gamma -\\alpha ) \\Gamma (\\gamma -\\beta )}+\\frac{\\Gamma (\\gamma ) z^{\\alpha -\\gamma } \\Gamma (\\alpha +\\beta -\\gamma ) (1-z)^{-\\alpha -\\beta +\\gamma } \\, _2F_1\\left(1-\\alpha ,\\gamma -\\alpha ;-\\alpha -\\beta +\\gamma +1;-\\frac{1-z}{z}\\right)}{\\Gamma (\\alpha ) \\Gamma (\\beta )}\\]","anchor":"cb4-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"HypergeometricAC[6][Hypergeometric2F1[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], z]]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[(1-z)^{-\\beta } \\, _2F_1\\left(\\beta ,\\gamma -\\alpha ;\\gamma ;-\\frac{z}{1-z}\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"HypergeometricAC[61][Hypergeometric2F1[\\[Alpha], \\[Beta], \\[Gamma], z]]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[(1-z)^{-\\alpha } \\, _2F_1\\left(\\alpha ,\\gamma -\\beta ;\\gamma ;-\\frac{z}{1-z}\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb6-1","section":"Examples"}]